TIP:  The intro is a snare drum over the top of bass note (c).  So cover the 6th string bass note (g) with your pinky and strum the top three strings with a (down, down-up-down-down) - (down, down-up-down-down) pattern.  Strum this pattern for four measures and then begin song.  This strumming pattern persists through the whole song.  If the (C/G) doesn't transpose play the transposed root chord.
 
   
